    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Family",
     "texto": [
      "**Родители** means «parents». **Сын** is «son» and **дочь**, «daughter». **Дети** means «children» or «kids».",
      "**Бабушка** is the grandmother and **дедушка**, the grandfather.",
      "To say what another person's name is: **Его зовут Сергей** (he is called Sergei), **её зовут Мария** (she is called Maria)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
